    "short_description": "An epic 2D pixel art style Metroidvania, inspired by Moroccan culture and spiritual traditions. Wield powerful ancient weapons and forge your way through unrelenting deserts, crumbling necropoli, floating islands and dangerous mountains as you try to uncover the secret of the last Djinn.",
    "supported_languages": "English, German, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese",
